| C1 | 33 | 94 | GOBP: GOLGI VESICLE TRANSPORT | COG3 (12), RAB1B (12), AKT1 (11), ARF1 (11), COG2 (11) | 19 |
| C2 | 54 | 56 | GOBP: ESTABLISHMENT OF PROTEIN LOCALIZATION TO ORGANELLE | NUP107 (54), NUP133 (54), NUP85 (54), NUP155 (53), NUP160 (53) | 8 |

